      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCO MISS (4) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (29.99) at Gosford behind Jungle Hollie in a Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Sure to be about the mark. SPEEDY PIE (1) boasts a strong record this course with nine wins and four minors from 15 tries. Hit the frame latest (30.53) when third at Wentworth Park in a Mix 1/2/3. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. BOSTON STRONG (2) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 2 lengths from MISTER ANATOLY in second (22.89) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Well-placed to take this out. MISTER ANATOLY (8) form at this distance reads well.",
